		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A 25-foot-tall human-shaped giant whose flesh is studded with a thousand eyes. Made as sentries by the titans. Loves music, can be bribed with beautiful songs.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 slam +6 (3d6) or baffling gaze, <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -1, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Baffling Gaze</strong>. Mortals in near of the argus, WIS 15+ or dazed for 1d6 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Watchful</strong>. ADV on initiative. Cannot be surprised.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
